	Frequency
	at [openEHR-EHR-COMPOSITION.report.v1]/content[openEHR-EHR-ACTION.medication.v1]/description[at0017]/items[openEHR-EHR-CLUSTER.dosage.v2]/items[openEHR-EHR-CLUSTER.timing_daily.v1]/items[at0003] = 3 times per day // frequency + periodUnit

